{
    "pr_body": "We simulate sending traffic along a blackholed connection with a disconnection exception that we withold until far into the future. Today this exception is delivered using the transport of the responding node, but it should be the requesting node. This commit fixes that.\r\n\r\nNot sure how this _ever_ worked, but we made things stricter in #92245 and that meant this bug led to test failures.\r\n\r\nCloses #92307",
